{"text":"a great deal of impostor syndrome. The first step to becoming an actor was to choose it for myself. Now, I am very indecisive. I'm a Pisces, I'm astrologically predisposed to not being able to make up my mind. And I accept that. But finding out that I wanted to be an actor was made a little more difficult because I was growing up in Nairobi, Kenya in the 80s where acting was just not a viable career path. Though I loved performance and making believe when I was little, nobody I knew around me was acting for a living. In school, it wasn't one of the professions you learned about. You could be a lawyer, a doctor, businessman or woman, secretary, policeman or woman, teacher, politician, but actor was never on the list. It didn't help that at the time in the 80s, we only had one TV station owned by the state and it had very boring programming for a child.","words":[{"text":"a","start":0.0,"end":0.78},{"text":"great","start":0.78,"end":1.08},{"text":"deal","start":1.08,"end":1.5},{"text":"of","start":1.5,"end":1.78},{"text":"impostor","start":1.78,"end":2.38},{"text":"syndrome","start":2.38,"end":2.76,"punct":"."},{"text":"The","start":4.46,"end":4.62},{"text":"first","start":4.62,"end":4.82},{"text":"step","start":4.82,"end":5.14},{"text":"to","start":5.14,"end":5.44},{"text":"becoming","start":5.44,"end":5.68},{"text":"an","start":5.68,"end":5.94},{"text":"actor","start":5.94,"end":6.14},{"text":"was","start":6.14,"end":6.48},{"text":"to","start":6.48,"end":6.88},{"text":"choose","start":6.88,"end":7.24},{"text":"it","start":7.24,"end":7.66},{"text":"for","start":7.66,"end":7.84},{"text":"myself","start":7.84,"end":8.2,"punct":"."},{"text":"Now","start":8.8,"end":8.96,"punct":","},{"text":"I","start":9.42,"end":9.66},{"text":"am","start":9.66,"end":9.82},{"text":"very","start":9.82,"end":10.24},{"text":"indecisive","start":10.24,"end":11.02,"punct":"."},{"text":"I'm","start":11.4,"end":11.64},{"text":"a","start":11.64,"end":11.66},{"text":"Pisces","start":11.6